infographic sequence-timeline-simple
data
  title Column rename username to handle: a 3-7 day calendar
  desc Each phase is a separate deploy; the spacing is the cost of zero-downtime
  sequences
    - label Day 1 - Expand + dual-write
      desc ADD COLUMN handle; deploy code writing both columns
    - label Day 2 - Backfill
      desc Copy old to new in 1k-10k row batches
    - label Day 3 - Cut over reads
      desc Read handle only; watch dashboards 24h
    - label Day 5 - Stop dual-write
      desc Write handle only; let rolling deploy drain
    - label Day 7 - Contract
      desc DROP COLUMN username (fast, metadata only)
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
